              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man gibibedo kud aba: an a aba migi; man wubimio igi piny ungo i kind Israel; an a piny migi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.28",
